<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>最厉害的黄雷荀</title>
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            font-family: '微软雅黑', sans-serif;
        }
        body {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a1a2e, #16213e);
            color: #fff;
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 40px 20px;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 600px;
            width: 100%;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .avatar {
            width: 200px;
            height: 200px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            border: 5px solid #e94560;
            object-fit: cover;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(233, 69, 96, 0.5);
        }
        h1 {
            font-size: 3rem;
            color: #e94560;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            text-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(233, 69, 96, 0.7);
        }
        .intro {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            line-height: 1.8;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
            color: #ccc;
        }
        .douyin-btn {
            display: inline-block;
            background: #000;
            color: #fff;
            padding: 15px 40px;
            border-radius: 50px;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            font-weight: bold;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            border: 2px solid #25f4ee;
        }
        .douyin-btn:hover {
            background: #25f4ee;
            color: #000;
            box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(37, 244, 238, 0.7);
            transform: scale(1.05);
        }
        footer {
            margin-top: 60px;
            color: #666;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <!-- 这里改你的照片！把src里的链接换成你自己的图片地址 -->
        <img src="hlx.png" alt="黄雷荀的照片" class="avatar">

        <h1>最厉害的黄雷荀</h1>

        <div class="intro">
            👋 哈喽！我是黄雷荀<br>
            🚴‍♂️ 骑行爱好者 | 💻 电脑技术党 | 🎮 全能玩家<br>
            📚 实验中学308班的技术大佬<br>
            ✨ 爱折腾、爱探索、永远不服输
        </div>

        <!-- 这里改你的抖音链接！把href里的#换成你的抖音分享链接 -->
        <a href="#" class="douyin-btn">👉 点击跳转到我的抖音</a>
    </div>

    <footer>
        Made with ❤️ by 黄雷荀 | 2026
    </footer>
</body>
</html>
